      (property "Description" "LQFP48; all supply domains common; ROM USB DFU with BOOT0/nBOOT1. PB2 PWR_HOLD, PA4 battery sense, PA5/PA6 charger status. PA2/PA3/PA9/PA10 remain free (ROM USART pins). Unused pins NC." (at 105.41 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
